# Mirrors images/base/.dockerignore. scripts/build_images.py already filters
# STAGE_EXCLUDE out of the staged context (so the content-hash label cannot
# lie about image content); this is the belt-and-braces copy for anyone who
# builds the staged directory by hand.
# NOTE: patterns anchor at the context root — nested directories need **/.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
**/.venv
